                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts178" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts180">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But I don't play about you, and I'm not prepared to watch other people play around with you or your family. I won't have it. So, do you know what I mean? But it's a really fine line. I don't want to be the reason that people you love leave, if that makes sense. But, yeah, that's a fear of mine. I'm like, I don't ever want.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
