                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts326" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts328">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But not because, like, I'm not because I'm like anywhere near finished with you. I have been in really beautiful relationships before where I wasn't checking in with myself, with my relationship, how I was feeling in it. Like, I have made that mistake of just being like, okay, it was good for those five months in the beginning, and we still talk every day or whatever, so it's still good. Nah, I've learned the hard way that that's really not how that works.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
