        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a56"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts334" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts338">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Happy to be in this relationship. Do I feel like this relationship is in service of me? Do I feel like I am doing my part in service of you? Do I feel like I am for you? Do you know what I mean? It's really easy to get comfortable and then just keep someone because they make you feel good, but you're not adding to them. You're not like you, I've seen people.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
