                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts339" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts340">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Like, watch their partner deteriorate. Do you know what I mean? I've been that partner, I've actually done that myself.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
